&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Senior Social Media Manager who will drive social operations for a leading global brand. You&#39;ll be a trusted client counsellor, coordinating activity and the VML social team to deliver truly social activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will become a &quot;go-to&quot; social guardian, helping the brand make the most of what social and VML has to offer. You&#39;ll own the social delivery for the client, working with social strategy and content creators, as well as the broader VML agency team, to bring it all together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about social media at scale, have your finger on the pulse, can manage a complex content calendar, and possess exceptional communication skills; we want to hear from you! This opportunity is primed for someone that&#39;s looking to deliver best-in-class social, whilst learning and upskilling themselves with a team of specialists.&lt;/p&gt;
