&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Foster strong collaborative relationships within the social team and wider VML team, working closely with strategy &amp;amp; planning, data &amp;amp; insights, client engagement, and creative. Begin to delegate tasks and share responsibility for outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage the pipeline of social content across multiple sources (including UGC and influencers), matching client needs with a strategic approach, to coordinate content creation and curation ahead of publishing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Present to senior clients and internal teams in a clear, concise, and persuasive manner, including new proposals, status updates, and performance reporting; all often of a highly complex nature. Respond spontaneously to issues or questions that arise.&lt;/li&gt;
