&lt;p&gt;Working as a core part of the cross-functional team, you’ll be one of the main point of contact for the client. Working closely with the Senior Account Director and the wider CRM team, you will be leading data-driven CRM campaigns (including emails and push notifications) and delivering toolkits that can be used by the different markets.&lt;/p&gt;
