&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;[Basic Paragraph]&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:57,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;[Basic Paragraph]&quot;&gt;At VML, we are a beacon of innovation and growth in an ever-evolving world. Our heritage is built upon a century of combined&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;[Basic Paragraph]&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;[Basic Paragraph]&quot;&gt;, where creativity meets technology, and diverse perspectives ignite inspiration. With the merger of VMLY&amp;amp;R and Wunderman Thompson, we have forged a new path as a growth partner that is part creative agency, part consultancy, and part technology powerhouse. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:57,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
