&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Consultant to deliver data integration, migration, and general development work for our clients, primarily in the UK financial services and alternative assets sectors. You&#39;ll work hands-on across the delivery lifecycle — from scoping and design through to build, test, and deployment — with growing ownership of workstreams and increasing client-facing responsibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
