&lt;li&gt;Contribute to engineering standards and delivery best practices as part of a wider team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the team to implement LLM-based processing in pipelines where appropriate, alongside deterministic logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on delivery teams building AI-enabled solutions on the platform, helping to apply trusted data to real client problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share learnings from delivery work and contribute to internal assets, tooling, and practices over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
